{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "a7c3e2b1-4f5d-4c8e-9a0b-screen-api-v1",
        "name": "My Bee — Screen API (شاشات)",
        "description": "**Tenant + Sanctum**\n\n- استخدم **Host** المستأجر فقط (مثل `https://test1.mybeesystem.net`).\n- **المسار الصحيح للمواد الإعلانية:** `GET/POST .../api/v1/screen/promos`\n- **ليس موجوداً:** `/api/promos` ولا `/promos` (سيظهر خطأ route not found).\n- `{{baseUrl}}` = `{{host}}/api/v1/screen` — ثم ألحق: `/promos`, `/playlists`, `/devices`, `/dashboard`.\n- توكن Sanctum في `token` (Bearer).\n\n**مطور موبايل:** إذا كان `serversub` = `https://tenant.com` فالمثال: `https://tenant.com/api/v1/screen/promos`\n\n---\n- رفع promo: `multipart/form-data`، الحقل `promo` (ملف).\n- Playlists: JSON — راجع مجلد Playlists.\n- IDs في الأمثلة وهمية — استبدلها من `dashboard` أو GET.\n",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "host",
            "value": "https://test1.mybeesystem.net"
        },
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "{{host}}/api/v1/screen"
        },
        {
            "key": "token",
            "value": ""
        },
        {
            "key": "promoId",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "playlistId",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "deviceId",
            "value": "1"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Dashboard",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Dashboard — بيانات الشاشة الرئيسية",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/dashboard",
                        "description": "يعيد: `promos`, `playlists_count`, `establishments`, `devices`, `has_establishment_column_on_devices`."
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "مثال 200",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "header": [],
                                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/dashboard"
                            },
                            "status": "OK",
                            "code": 200,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [],
                            "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"promos\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"إعلان صيفي\",\n        \"path\": \"promos/abc.mp4\",\n        \"media_url\": \"https://test1.mybeesystem.net/storage/tenant1/promos/abc.mp4\",\n        \"thumbnail\": \"promos/abc_thumb.jpg\",\n        \"thumbnail_url\": \"https://test1.mybeesystem.net/storage/tenant1/promos/abc_thumb.jpg\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"playlists_count\": 3,\n    \"establishments\": [{ \"id\": 2, \"name\": \"فرع الشمال\" }],\n    \"devices\": [{ \"id\": 1, \"code\": \"SCR-001\", \"establishment_id\": 2, \"establishment_name\": \"فرع الشمال\" }],\n    \"has_establishment_column_on_devices\": true\n  }\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Promos — مواد إعلانية",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "List promos",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
