                {
                    "name": "Create playlist — every_day",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"قائمة الفرع الرئيسي\",\n  \"days_settings\": \"every_day\",\n  \"start_time\": \"08:00\",\n  \"transition_seconds\": 10,\n  \"screen_orientation\": \"landscape\",\n  \"establishments_ids\": [2, 3],\n  \"devices\": [1, 2],\n  \"selected_promos\": [5, 6, 7],\n  \"days_of_the_weak\": [],\n  \"start_date_time\": null\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/playlists",
                        "description": "`days_settings`: `every_day` | `days_of_the_weak` | `custom_date_time` | `manual`\n\n- مع `every_day` أو `days_of_the_weak`: `start_time` مطلوب (H:i).\n- مع `days_of_the_weak`: مصفوفة `days_of_the_weak` بأسماء أيام إنجليزية صغيرة.\n- مع `custom_date_time`: `start_date_time` بصيغة `Y-m-d H:i`.\n- `transition_seconds`: 1–300.\n- الأجهزة يجب أن تنتمي للمنشآت المحددة (إن وُجد عمود establishment_id)."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Create playlist — days_of_the_weak",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"عطلة نهاية الأسبوع\",\n  \"days_settings\": \"days_of_the_weak\",\n  \"start_time\": \"10:00\",\n  \"days_of_the_weak\": [\"thursday\", \"friday\", \"saturday\"],\n  \"transition_seconds\": 15,\n  \"screen_orientation\": \"portrait\",\n  \"establishments_ids\": [2],\n  \"devices\": [1],\n  \"selected_promos\": [5],\n  \"start_date_time\": null\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/playlists"
                    },
                    "response": []
